  "prefLabel": "Nuh 104.02 Custodian of Records",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-07-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 104.02 Custodian of Records. The office of professional licensure and certification shall be the custodian of the board’s records and shall respond to requests to examine those portions of the board's records which are subject to public inspection or which may otherwise be properly examined by the person requesting access.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01, EXPIRED: 7-1-09\n\nNew. #12435, eff 12-16-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nuh100-500.html"
